{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "ranked-bars",
  "title": "Ranked bars",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 3.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Rows of a label, a horizontal bar and its value, sorted longest first: top sources, top pages, best scores. Long labels stay readable because they sit beside (or inside) the bar instead of under it, and every row shares one grid so bars and values line up.",
    "id": "Baris berisi label, batang horizontal, dan nilainya, diurutkan dari yang terpanjang: sumber teratas, halaman teratas, skor terbaik. Label panjang tetap terbaca karena berada di samping (atau di dalam) batang, bukan di bawahnya, dan setiap baris berbagi satu grid sehingga batang dan nilai sejajar."
  },
  "titleId": "Ranked bars",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Top sources with their change",
        "desc": "Icon, name, bar, visits and the change against last month. Point at a row to bring it forward. Bars grow in on first view.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-src\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-src\">Where do service portal visitors come from?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Visits by source, November</div></div>\n  <div class=\"hbars\" role=\"list\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Visits by source\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">search</span></span><span>Search</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">4,210<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>12%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">mail</span></span><span>Newsletter</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 56.5%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">2,380<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>4%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">location_city</span></span><span>Kelurahan websites</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 40.6%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">1,710<span class=\"delta delta--bad delta--down\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>6%<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">share</span></span><span>Social posts</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 22.8%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">960<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>21%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">link</span></span><span>Direct</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 15.2%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">640<span class=\"delta delta--bad delta--down\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>2%<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Leaderboard",
        "desc": "Rank, avatar and service unit under the name; one quiet color so the gaps carry the story.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-lead\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-lead\">Which officers do citizens rate best?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Citizen satisfaction out of 100, top five, this quarter</div></div>\n  <div class=\"hbars\" role=\"list\" data-lds-grow style=\"--label-w: 220px;\" aria-label=\"Top five satisfaction scores\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">1</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NP</span><span><span>Nadia Putri</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Business permit counter</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 96%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">96</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">2</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">RH</span><span><span>Rizky Hartono</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">KTP counter</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 91%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">91</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">3</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ML</span><span><span>Mei Lin Tan</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Business permit counter</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 88%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">88</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">4</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DS</span><span><span>Dimas Saputra</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Complaints desk</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 84%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">84</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">5</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AL</span><span><span>Ayu Lestari</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">KTP counter</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 79%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">79</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Labels inside, switching the period",
        "desc": "Long paths fit inside tint bars. Switch the period: bars move to their new lengths over 480 ms.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-pages\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-pages\">Which pages get read?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Views per page</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\"><div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Period\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 200px;\"><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('[data-a]').forEach((n) => n.classList.contains('hbar__fill') ? n.style.setProperty('--v', n.dataset.a) : (n.textContent = n.dataset.a))\">November</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('[data-b]').forEach((n) => n.classList.contains('hbar__fill') ? n.style.setProperty('--v', n.dataset.b) : (n.textContent = n.dataset.b))\">October</button></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hbars hbars--inside\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Views per page\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\" data-a=\"100.0%\" data-b=\"79.5%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/services/e-ktp\" data-b=\"/services/e-ktp\">/services/e-ktp</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"3,120\" data-b=\"2,480\">3,120</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 70.8%;\" data-a=\"70.8%\" data-b=\"65.7%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/levy-rates\" data-b=\"/services/business-permit\">/levy-rates</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"2,210\" data-b=\"2,050\">2,210</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 52.6%;\" data-a=\"52.6%\" data-b=\"55.4%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/services/business-permit\" data-b=\"/levy-rates\">/services/business-permit</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"1,640\" data-b=\"1,730\">1,640</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 31.4%;\" data-a=\"31.4%\" data-b=\"38.8%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/news/posyandu-schedule\" data-b=\"/news/service-holiday\">/news/posyandu-schedule</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"980\" data-b=\"1,210\">980</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 13.1%;\" data-a=\"13.1%\" data-b=\"20.5%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/about\" data-b=\"/news/posyandu-schedule\">/about</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"410\" data-b=\"640\">410</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "code": "<div class=\"hbars hbars--inside\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Views per page\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100%;\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\">/services/e-ktp</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">3,120</span></div>\n  …\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Sumber teratas dengan perubahannya",
        "desc": "Ikon, nama, batang, jumlah kunjungan, dan perubahannya dibanding bulan lalu. Arahkan kursor ke satu baris untuk menonjolkannya. Batang tumbuh saat pertama terlihat.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-src\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-src\">Dari mana pengunjung portal layanan datang?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Kunjungan menurut sumber, November</div></div>\n  <div class=\"hbars\" role=\"list\" data-lds-grow aria-label=\"Kunjungan menurut sumber\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">search</span></span><span>Mesin pencari</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">4.210<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>12%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">mail</span></span><span>Buletin email</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 56.5%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">2.380<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>4%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">location_city</span></span><span>Situs kelurahan</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 40.6%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">1.710<span class=\"delta delta--bad delta--down\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>6%<span class=\"sr-only\"> turun</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">share</span></span><span>Media sosial</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 22.8%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">960<span class=\"delta delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>21%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span></span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">link</span></span><span>Langsung</span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 15.2%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">640<span class=\"delta delta--bad delta--down\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>2%<span class=\"sr-only\"> turun</span></span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Papan peringkat",
        "desc": "Urutan, avatar, dan unit layanan di bawah nama; satu warna yang tenang agar selisihnya yang bercerita.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-lead\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-lead\">Petugas mana yang paling dinilai baik?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Skor kepuasan warga dari 100, lima teratas, triwulan ini</div></div>\n  <div class=\"hbars\" role=\"list\" data-lds-grow style=\"--label-w: 220px;\" aria-label=\"Lima skor kepuasan teratas\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">1</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">NP</span><span><span>Nadia Putri</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Loket izin usaha</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 96%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">96</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">2</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">RH</span><span><span>Rizky Hartono</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Loket KTP</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 91%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">91</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">3</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ML</span><span><span>Mei Lin Tan</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Loket izin usaha</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 88%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">88</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">4</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DS</span><span><span>Dimas Saputra</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Layanan pengaduan</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 84%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">84</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__label\"><span class=\"hbar__rank\">5</span><span class=\"avatar avatar--gray hbar__media\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AL</span><span><span>Ayu Lestari</span><span class=\"hbar__sub\">Loket KTP</span></span></span><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 79%;\"></span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">79</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Label di dalam, mengganti periode",
        "desc": "Alamat halaman yang panjang muat di dalam batang tint. Ganti periodenya: batang bergerak ke panjang barunya selama 480 ms.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 480px;\" aria-labelledby=\"rb-pages\">\n  <div class=\"chart-card__head\"><div class=\"chart-card__titles\"><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"rb-pages\">Halaman mana yang paling dibaca?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Jumlah tayangan per halaman</div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-card__actions\"><div class=\"seg chart-card__range\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Periode\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 200px;\"><span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('[data-a]').forEach((n) => n.classList.contains('hbar__fill') ? n.style.setProperty('--v', n.dataset.a) : (n.textContent = n.dataset.a))\">November</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"this.closest('.chart-card').querySelectorAll('[data-b]').forEach((n) => n.classList.contains('hbar__fill') ? n.style.setProperty('--v', n.dataset.b) : (n.textContent = n.dataset.b))\">Oktober</button></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hbars hbars--inside\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Tayangan per halaman\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100.0%;\" data-a=\"100.0%\" data-b=\"79.5%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/layanan/ktp-elektronik\" data-b=\"/layanan/ktp-elektronik\">/layanan/ktp-elektronik</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"3.120\" data-b=\"2.480\">3.120</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 70.8%;\" data-a=\"70.8%\" data-b=\"65.7%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/tarif-retribusi\" data-b=\"/layanan/izin-usaha\">/tarif-retribusi</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"2.210\" data-b=\"2.050\">2.210</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 52.6%;\" data-a=\"52.6%\" data-b=\"55.4%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/layanan/izin-usaha\" data-b=\"/tarif-retribusi\">/layanan/izin-usaha</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"1.640\" data-b=\"1.730\">1.640</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 31.4%;\" data-a=\"31.4%\" data-b=\"38.8%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/berita/jadwal-posyandu\" data-b=\"/berita/libur-pelayanan\">/berita/jadwal-posyandu</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"980\" data-b=\"1.210\">980</span></div>\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 13.1%;\" data-a=\"13.1%\" data-b=\"20.5%\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\" data-a=\"/tentang\" data-b=\"/berita/jadwal-posyandu\">/tentang</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\" data-a=\"410\" data-b=\"640\">410</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "code": "<div class=\"hbars hbars--inside\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Tayangan per halaman\">\n  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"hbar is-top\"><span class=\"hbar__track\"><span class=\"hbar__fill\" style=\"--v: 100%;\"></span><span class=\"hbar__label\">/layanan/ktp-elektronik</span></span><span class=\"hbar__val\">3.120</span></div>\n  …\n</div>"
